  "instructions": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "primary_message": "Let ice cream soften on counter until softened and easily scoopable, about 15 minutes. Combine ice cream, milk, peppermint extract, food coloring, if using, and salt in food processor and process, scraping down sides of bowl as needed, until smooth, about 1 minute. Pour into 2 chilled glasses. Top each shake with whipped cream and a cherry. Serve.",
